{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================================
  PF FOOTER — v2
  Rebuilt from the client mockup "Footer.dc.html", variant 1a (DARK / ACTION-LED).

  Four bands, top to bottom:
    1. CTA        — 21+ years badge, h2 promise, sub-line, 280px action stack
    2. STATS      — four hairline-divided cells with CMYK colour bars
    3. COLUMNS    — 3 link columns (blocks) + 1 "talk to a human" contact column
    4. BOTTOM BAR — copyright + legal nav (left), mono tagline (right), on #1B2542

  DELIBERATE DIFFERENCES FROM THE MOCKUP (all documented in the handover):
    - Palette remapped to the LIVE theme tokens, not the mockup's drifted values
      (#0D1729->#141C33, #0A1120->#1B2542, #E6187B->#E20A6E, #1AA9C4->#0899B4,
       #F2C31B->#F0B408). The mockup's display face is NOT loaded: Inter (Shopify
      font_picker) + IBM Plex Mono (already in the theme's Google Fonts link) only.
      This section loads no webfont of its own.
    - "Fabric seam guide", not "Fabric width & seam guide" — the printable-width
      content was removed from /pages/width-and-seams at the client's request, so
      the mockup label would promise content the page no longer has. (The page is
      in fact already titled "Fabric Seam Guide".)
    - "Trade & reseller pricing" dropped from COMPANY — no such page exists.
    - Tagline reads "PRINTED TO ORDER · SHIPPED WORLDWIDE". The mockup's wording
      asserted where the printing physically happens, which we have no source for.
      "Printed to order" is the brand's already-established line.
    - Link hover resolves to #FFFFFF, not magenta. #E20A6E on #141C33 is 3.67:1,
      below WCAG AA for 15px text. The magenta accent is retained on the single
      "ALL 17 FABRICS" index link, faithful to the mockup's hierarchy.
    - The mockup's non-standard hover attribute is not used anywhere. Every hover
      state is a real CSS :hover rule in the style block at the foot of this file.

  CONTACT COLUMN — client supplied the address and phone on 2026-08-03:
    - Column 4 carries a tel: phone card and an <address> block alongside the
      single email card. Both are driven by section settings (phone / address) so
      they stay editable, and both render nothing when their setting is empty,
      exactly like the email card.

  SINGLE MAILBOX — 2026-08-03:
    - The client consolidated to one mailbox. sales@ is now the only address on
      the site. The second email card (email_support / email_support_desc) has
      been removed rather than pointed at sales@, because two cards showing the
      same address with split routing copy would read as two queues that no
      longer exist. email_sales_desc now describes the whole remit.
    - The retired .pff2__mail--support rule is gone with it; nothing emits that
      class any more.
    - The tel: href is DERIVED from the display number by stripping spaces,
      brackets and dashes. One setting, so the dialled number can never drift
      away from the printed one.
    - The <address> element is forced to font-style:normal; browsers italicise it
      by default and the rest of the card stack is upright.
    - NO opening-hours line has been added. Hours have never been supplied. The
      existing response-time line (hours_line) is untouched.

  ACCESSIBILITY / STRUCTURE NOTES:
    - This section deliberately emits NO footer landmark element. layout/theme.liquid
      already wraps the footer section group in one, and now carries
      role="contentinfo" on it. Emitting a second here would duplicate the landmark.
    - CMYK squares and stat colour bars are purely decorative -> aria-hidden.
    - The four stat figures are hardcoded on purpose. "24-48 hrs" and "7-10 days"
      are contractual claims; making them theme-editor settings invites drift.
    - :focus-visible is forced with !important because the theme resets
      outline:none globally.
  ============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign quote_url = section.settings.quote_fallback_url
  if quote_url == blank
    assign quote_url = '/pages/contact'
  endif
-%}

<div class="pf-footer-v2">

  {%- comment -%} ---------- BAND 1: CTA ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="pff2__band pff2__cta">
    <div class="pff2__in">
      <div class="pff2__cta-copy">
        {%- if section.settings.show_badge -%}
          <span class="pff2__badge">
            <span class="pff2__cmyk" aria-hidden="true">
              <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
            </span>
            <span class="pff2__badge-t">{{ section.settings.badge_text }}</span>
          </span>
        {%- endif -%}

        <h2 class="pff2__h2">{{ section.settings.cta_heading }}</h2>
        <p class="pff2__sub">{{ section.settings.cta_subline }}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pff2__actions">
        {%- comment -%}
          Reuses the header's quote mechanism verbatim (snippets/header-actions.liquid):
          the <dialog id="pf-quote-modal"> is rendered by the header on every page.
          Progressively enhanced: a real href so it works with JS off / for crawlers,
          upgraded to the modal when <dialog> is supported.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <a
          class="pff2__btn pff2__btn--primary"
          href="{{ quote_url }}"
          onclick="var d=document.getElementById('pf-quote-modal'); if(d&&d.showModal){d.showModal();return false;}"
        >
          <span>{{ section.settings.btn_primary_label }}</span>
          <span class="pff2__arw" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>

        <a class="pff2__btn pff2__btn--ghost" href="{{ section.settings.btn_secondary_url }}">
          <span>{{ section.settings.btn_secondary_label }}</span>
          <span class="pff2__arw" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>

        <span class="pff2__cap">{{ section.settings.cta_caption }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- BAND 2: FOUR-STAT STRIP ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="pff2__band pff2__stats">
    <div class="pff2__in">
      <div class="pff2__statgrid">
        <div class="pff2__stat">
          <span class="pff2__bar pff2__bar--c" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div class="pff2__fig">Free proof</div>
          <div class="pff2__figd">on every order &mdash; nothing prints until you approve it</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pff2__stat">
          <span class="pff2__bar pff2__bar--m" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div class="pff2__fig">24&ndash;48 hrs</div>
          <div class="pff2__figd">on our dye-sublimation and UV presses</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pff2__stat">
          <span class="pff2__bar pff2__bar--y" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div class="pff2__fig">7&ndash;10 days</div>
          <div class="pff2__figd">to USA, UK, EU, Australia, NZ and Canada</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pff2__stat">
          <span class="pff2__bar pff2__bar--k" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div class="pff2__fig">Free design</div>
          <div class="pff2__figd">send a brief, get a print-ready mockup back</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- BAND 3: LINK COLUMNS ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="pff2__band pff2__cols">
    <div class="pff2__in">

      {%- comment -%} Column 1 — WHAT WE PRINT (fabric_link blocks) {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="pff2__col">
        <h3 class="pff2__h3" id="pff2-h-print">{{ section.settings.heading_print }}</h3>
        <nav class="pff2__nav" aria-labelledby="pff2-h-print">
          <ul class="pff2__list">
            {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
              {%- if block.type == 'fabric_link' and block.settings.enabled -%}
                {%- if block.settings.is_index -%}
                  <li class="pff2__all-li" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                    <a class="pff2__all" href="{{ block.settings.url }}">
                      <span>{{ block.settings.label }}</span>
                      <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
                    </a>
                  </li>
                {%- else -%}
                  <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                    <a href="{{ block.settings.url }}">{{ block.settings.label }}</a>
                  </li>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Column 2 — BEFORE YOU ORDER (service_link blocks) {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="pff2__col">
        <h3 class="pff2__h3" id="pff2-h-service">{{ section.settings.heading_service }}</h3>
        <nav class="pff2__nav" aria-labelledby="pff2-h-service">
          <ul class="pff2__list">
            {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
              {%- if block.type == 'service_link' and block.settings.enabled -%}
                <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                  <a href="{{ block.settings.url }}">{{ block.settings.label }}</a>
                </li>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Column 3 — COMPANY (company_link blocks) {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="pff2__col">
        <h3 class="pff2__h3" id="pff2-h-company">{{ section.settings.heading_company }}</h3>
        <nav class="pff2__nav" aria-labelledby="pff2-h-company">
          <ul class="pff2__list">
            {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
              {%- if block.type == 'company_link' and block.settings.enabled -%}
                <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                  <a href="{{ block.settings.url }}">{{ block.settings.label }}</a>
                </li>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Column 4 — TALK TO A HUMAN (one email card, phone, address) {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="pff2__col">
        <h3 class="pff2__h3">{{ section.settings.heading_contact }}</h3>

        {%- if section.settings.email_sales != blank -%}
          <a class="pff2__mail pff2__mail--sales" href="mailto:{{ section.settings.email_sales }}">
            <span class="pff2__mail-a">{{ section.settings.email_sales }}</span>
            <span class="pff2__mail-d">{{ section.settings.email_sales_desc }}</span>
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          Phone. The tel: href is derived from the display number, never typed twice:
          "+1 (469) 619-9453" -> "+14696199453".
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if section.settings.phone != blank -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign phone_href = section.settings.phone | remove: ' ' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' | remove: '-' | remove: '.'
          -%}
          <a class="pff2__mail pff2__mail--phone" href="tel:{{ phone_href }}">
            <span class="pff2__mail-a">{{ section.settings.phone }}</span>
            {%- if section.settings.phone_desc != blank -%}
              <span class="pff2__mail-d">{{ section.settings.phone_desc }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.address != blank -%}
          <address class="pff2__mail pff2__mail--addr">
            <span class="pff2__mail-a pff2__mail-a--addr">{{ section.settings.address | escape | newline_to_br }}</span>
            {%- if section.settings.address_desc != blank -%}
              <span class="pff2__mail-d">{{ section.settings.address_desc }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </address>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.hours_line != blank -%}
          <p class="pff2__hours">{{ section.settings.hours_line }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- BAND 4: BOTTOM BAR ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="pff2__bottom">
    <div class="pff2__in">
      <div class="pff2__legal">
        <span class="pff2__copy">{{ section.settings.copyright_text }}</span>
        <nav aria-label="Legal">
          <ul class="pff2__legal-list">
            {%- if section.settings.url_privacy != blank -%}
              <li><a href="{{ section.settings.url_privacy }}">Privacy Policy</a></li>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.url_terms != blank -%}
              <li><a href="{{ section.settings.url_terms }}">Terms of Service</a></li>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.url_accessibility != blank -%}
              <li><a href="{{ section.settings.url_accessibility }}">Accessibility</a></li>
            {%- endif -%}
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <div class="pff2__tag">{{ section.settings.tagline }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

{%- style -%}
  .pf-footer-v2{
    --pff2-navy:#141C33;
    --pff2-inset:#1B2542;
    --pff2-magenta:#E20A6E;
    --pff2-magenta-dk:#C1085D;
    --pff2-cyan:#0899B4;
    --pff2-yellow:#F0B408;
    --pff2-hair:rgba(255,255,255,.09);
    --pff2-hair-2:rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    --pff2-body:#A6B1C7;
    --pff2-link:#C3CADD;
    --pff2-meta:#7C88A2;
    --pff2-bottom:#8B95AB;
    --pff2-badge:#C6CEDE;
    --pff2-sans:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
    --pff2-mono:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;
    --pff2-container:1240px;
    --pff2-gutter:24px;
    background:var(--pff2-navy);
    color:var(--pff2-body);
    font-family:var(--pff2-sans);
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:clip;
  }
  .pf-footer-v2 *,
  .pf-footer-v2 *::before,
  .pf-footer-v2 *::after{ box-sizing:border-box; }
  .pf-footer-v2 a{ color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
  .pf-footer-v2 p{ margin:0; }
  .pf-footer-v2 address{ font-style:normal; margin:0; }

  .pff2__in{
    width:100%;
    max-width:var(--pff2-container);
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 var(--pff2-gutter);
  }

  /* --- Focus. The theme resets outline:none globally, so this is forced. --- */
  .pf-footer-v2 a:focus-visible,
  .pf-footer-v2 button:focus-visible{
    outline:2px solid var(--pff2-yellow) !important;
    outline-offset:3px !important;
    border-radius:2px;
  }

  /* ============ BAND 1 — CTA ============ */
  .pff2__cta{ border-bottom:1px solid var(--pff2-hair); }
  .pff2__cta .pff2__in{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:48px;
    padding-top:52px;
    padding-bottom:52px;
  }
  .pff2__cta-copy{ max-width:640px; min-width:0; }

  .pff2__badge{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    padding:6px 12px 6px 8px;
    border:1px solid var(--pff2-hair-2);
    border-radius:999px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .pff2__cmyk{ display:flex; gap:3px; flex:none; }
  .pff2__cmyk i{ display:block; width:8px; height:8px; }
  .pff2__cmyk i:nth-child(1){ background:var(--pff2-cyan); }
  .pff2__cmyk i:nth-child(2){ background:var(--pff2-magenta); }
  .pff2__cmyk i:nth-child(3){ background:var(--pff2-yellow); }
  .pff2__cmyk i:nth-child(4){ background:#fff; }
  .pff2__badge-t{
    font-family:var(--pff2-mono);
    font-size:11px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:.16em;
    line-height:1;
    color:var(--pff2-badge);
    white-space:nowrap;
  }

  .pf-footer-v2 .pff2__h2{
    margin:0 0 10px;
    font-family:var(--pff2-sans);
    font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,38px);
    line-height:1.1;
    font-weight:800;
    letter-spacing:-.02em;
    color:#fff;
    text-transform:none;
    text-wrap:pretty;
  }
  .pff2__sub{
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.5;
    color:var(--pff2-body);
    text-wrap:pretty;
  }

  .pff2__actions{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:12px;
    flex:none;
    width:280px;
  }
  .pff2__btn{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:12px;
    font-family:inherit;
    font-size:16px;
    font-weight:700;
    line-height:1.25;
    color:#fff;
    border:0;
    cursor:pointer;
    text-align:left;
    transition:background-color .15s ease, border-color .15s ease;
  }
  .pff2__btn--primary{ background:var(--pff2-magenta); padding:17px 22px; }
  .pff2__btn--primary:hover{ background:var(--pff2-magenta-dk); }

  /* MOBILE ONLY — the header owns this CTA on desktop.

     From 750px up, header-actions renders its own "Get instant quote"
     button; below that it is moved into the menu drawer instead. Keeping
     the footer copy at every width therefore puts two identical CTAs on
     one desktop screen, so this one stands down exactly where the header
     one appears — every width keeps exactly one, and never two.

     750px, deliberately, and not one of this file's own 1000/600/400
     breakpoints: this rule has to track the button it is complementing,
     not the footer's layout. If the header breakpoint ever moves, move
     this with it. Only the primary button is affected — "Order free
     swatches" has no header equivalent and stays at every width. */
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .pff2__btn--primary {
      display: none;
    }
  }
  .pff2__btn--ghost{
    background:transparent;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);
    padding:16px 22px;
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .pff2__btn--ghost:hover{ border-color:#fff; background:rgba(255,255,255,.06); }
  .pff2__arw{ font-size:18px; line-height:1; flex:none; }
  .pff2__cap{
    font-family:var(--pff2-mono);
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.12em;
    line-height:1.4;
    color:var(--pff2-meta);
    padding-top:2px;
  }

  /* ============ BAND 2 — FOUR-STAT STRIP ============ */
  .pff2__stats{ border-bottom:1px solid var(--pff2-hair); }
  .pff2__statgrid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); }
  .pff2__stat{
    padding:34px 32px;
    border-left:1px solid var(--pff2-hair);
    min-width:0;
  }
  .pff2__stat:first-child{ border-left:0; padding-left:0; }
  .pff2__stat:last-child{ padding-right:0; }
  .pff2__bar{ display:block; width:28px; height:4px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .pff2__bar--c{ background:var(--pff2-cyan); }
  .pff2__bar--m{ background:var(--pff2-magenta); }
  .pff2__bar--y{ background:var(--pff2-yellow); }
  .pff2__bar--k{ background:#fff; }
  .pff2__fig{
    font-size:30px;
    font-weight:800;
    letter-spacing:-.02em;
    line-height:1;
    color:#fff;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .pff2__figd{
    font-size:15px;
    line-height:1.45;
    color:var(--pff2-body);
    margin-top:8px;
  }

  /* ============ BAND 3 — LINK COLUMNS ============ */
  .pff2__cols .pff2__in{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1.1fr 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap:40px;
    padding-top:52px;
    padding-bottom:52px;
  }
  .pff2__col{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; min-width:0; }
  .pf-footer-v2 .pff2__h3{
    margin:0;
    font-family:var(--pff2-mono);
    font-size:11px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:.16em;
    line-height:1.2;
    color:var(--pff2-meta);
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .pff2__list{
    list-style:none;
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:11px;
  }
  .pff2__list li{ margin:0; }
  .pff2__list a{
    font-size:15px;
    font-weight:500;
    line-height:1.3;
    color:var(--pff2-link);
    transition:color .15s ease;
  }
  .pff2__list a:hover{ color:#fff; }

  .pff2__all-li{ margin-top:3px; }
  .pff2__all{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:6px;
    font-family:var(--pff2-mono);
    font-size:12px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:.1em;
    line-height:1.2;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--pff2-magenta);
    transition:color .15s ease;
  }
  .pff2__list .pff2__all{ font-size:12px; font-weight:600; color:var(--pff2-magenta); }
  .pff2__list .pff2__all:hover{ color:#fff; }

  .pff2__mail{
    display:block;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);
    border-left:3px solid var(--pff2-cyan);
    padding:14px 16px;
    transition:background-color .15s ease;
  }
  .pff2__mail--phone{ border-left-color:var(--pff2-yellow); }
  .pff2__mail--addr{
    border-left-color:#fff;
    font-style:normal;
    cursor:default;
  }
  .pff2__mail:hover{ background:rgba(255,255,255,.10); }
  .pff2__mail--addr:hover{ background:rgba(255,255,255,.05); }
  .pff2__mail-a{
    display:block;
    font-size:16px;
    font-weight:700;
    line-height:1.25;
    color:#fff;
    overflow-wrap:anywhere;
  }
  .pff2__mail-a--addr{
    font-size:15px;
    font-weight:600;
    line-height:1.45;
    overflow-wrap:break-word;
  }
  .pff2__mail-d{
    display:block;
    font-size:13px;
    line-height:1.4;
    color:var(--pff2-body);
    margin-top:3px;
  }
  .pff2__hours{ font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--pff2-meta); }

  /* ============ BAND 4 — BOTTOM BAR ============ */
  .pff2__bottom{
    background:var(--pff2-inset);
    border-top:1px solid var(--pff2-hair);
  }
  .pff2__bottom .pff2__in{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:16px 24px;
    padding-top:22px;
    padding-bottom:22px;
  }
  .pff2__legal{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:12px 20px;
    font-size:13px;
    line-height:1.4;
    color:var(--pff2-bottom);
    min-width:0;
  }
  .pff2__copy{ font-weight:600; color:var(--pff2-badge); }
  .pff2__legal-list{
    list-style:none;
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:12px 20px;
  }
  .pff2__legal-list a{ transition:color .15s ease; }
  .pff2__legal-list a:hover{ color:#fff; }
  .pff2__tag{
    font-family:var(--pff2-mono);
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    line-height:1.4;
    color:var(--pff2-meta);
    white-space:nowrap;
  }

  /* ============ RESPONSIVE — 2 cols under 1000px ============ */
  @media screen and (max-width:1000px){
    .pff2__cta .pff2__in{
      flex-direction:column;
      align-items:flex-start;
      gap:32px;
      padding-top:44px;
      padding-bottom:44px;
    }
    .pff2__cta-copy{ max-width:none; }
    .pff2__actions{ width:100%; max-width:360px; }

    .pff2__statgrid{ grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
    .pff2__stat{ padding:26px 24px; }
    .pff2__stat:nth-child(2n+1){ border-left:0; padding-left:0; }
    .pff2__stat:nth-child(2n){ padding-right:0; }
    .pff2__stat:nth-child(n+3){ border-top:1px solid var(--pff2-hair); }

    .pff2__cols .pff2__in{
      grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
      gap:36px 40px;
      padding-top:44px;
      padding-bottom:44px;
    }
  }

  /* ============ RESPONSIVE — 1 col under 600px ============ */
  @media screen and (max-width:600px){
    .pff2__cta .pff2__in{ padding-top:36px; padding-bottom:36px; gap:28px; }
    .pff2__badge{ margin-bottom:16px; }
    .pff2__badge-t{ font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.12em; }
    .pff2__sub{ font-size:16px; }
    .pff2__actions{ max-width:none; }

    .pff2__stats .pff2__in{ padding-top:28px; padding-bottom:28px; }
    .pff2__statgrid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .pff2__stat{
      padding:20px 0;
      border-left:0;
      border-top:1px solid var(--pff2-hair);
    }
    .pff2__stat:nth-child(2n+1),
    .pff2__stat:nth-child(2n){ padding-left:0; padding-right:0; }
    .pff2__stat:first-child{ border-top:0; padding-top:0; }
    .pff2__fig{ font-size:26px; }

    .pff2__cols .pff2__in{
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
      gap:32px;
      padding-top:36px;
      padding-bottom:36px;
    }

    .pff2__bottom .pff2__in{
      flex-direction:column;
      align-items:flex-start;
      gap:14px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width:400px){
    .pff2__tag{ font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.1em; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    .pf-footer-v2 *{ transition:none !important; }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

